    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Time combines puzzle elements with tactical gameplay. Play as dwellers and guests of the fantasy forest, helping them meet their goals in this peaceful, family-friendly turn-based puzzle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can plan your actions carefully to complete everything on time, or experiment and explore the levels to your heart\u2019s content. The game is set in a peaceful environment and doesn\u2019t punish you for learning through trial and error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/2fc51f38fc76c9e772fd7ffe94081b96.poster.avif?t=1751348610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/2fc51f38fc76c9e772fd7ffe94081b96.webm?t=1751348610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/2fc51f38fc76c9e772fd7ffe94081b96.mp4?t=1751348610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variety of Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many characters in the game, and each one is unique in its own way. Explore their abilities and quirks in various settings and master each one of them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many levels to solve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 40 puzzles, there are many tasks to solve: from collecting fruits and berries and chatting with friends to trick-or-treating or playing with spirits during seasonal festive events.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Time combines puzzle elements with tactical gameplay. Play as dwellers and guests of the fantasy forest, helping them meet their goals in this peaceful, family-friendly turn-based puzzle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can plan your actions carefully to complete everything on time, or experiment and explore the levels to your heart\u2019s content. The game is set in a peaceful environment and doesn\u2019t punish you for learning through trial and error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/2fc51f38fc76c9e772fd7ffe94081b96.poster.avif?t=1751348610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/2fc51f38fc76c9e772fd7ffe94081b96.webm?t=1751348610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/2fc51f38fc76c9e772fd7ffe94081b96.mp4?t=1751348610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variety of Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many characters in the game, and each one is unique in its own way. Explore their abilities and quirks in various settings and master each one of them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many levels to solve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 40 puzzles, there are many tasks to solve: from collecting fruits and berries and chatting with friends to trick-or-treating or playing with spirits during seasonal festive events.</p>",
    "short_description": "Forest Time is a tactical game with a cozy experience. Enjoy various puzzles in a charming, vibrant world with peaceful yet challenging tasks.",
